[[File:Eye of Ayak spell.gif|thumb|250px|A player using the Eye of Ayak's built-in spell.]]
The '''Eye of Ayak''' is a one-handed [[powered staff]] that requires level 83 [[Magic]] to wield. It is a drop from the [[Doom of Mokhaiotl]] upon completion of delve level 3 and higher. Like most powered staves, it is only tradeable when it is fully uncharged.

It is the second strongest powered staff, with its strength placed between that of the [[Sanguinesti staff]] and [[Tumeken's shadow]]. Its unique trait is that it attacks every 3 ticks, compared to the 4- or 5-tick attack cycles of other staves. This makes its max hit lower compared to other options, but its faster attack speed makes up for the lowered damage.

The Eye of Ayak can be dismantled for 10,000 [[demon tear]]s, resulting in a loss of {{NoCoins|{{GEP|Demon tear|10000}}-{{GEP|Eye of Ayak (uncharged)}}|c}}.

The Eye of Ayak cannot be used in [[Castle Wars]], [[Clan Wars]], [[TzHaar Fight Pit]], and [[Soul Wars]], despite all other powered staves being usable against players in those areas.

The Eye of Ayak does not lose charges on death in the [[Wilderness]] if the item is [[Items Kept on Death|protected]], even if the death occurs past level 20 Wilderness. 

